<title>UK: Oseberg due to load 44 standard cargoes in Jan.</title>
<headline>Oseberg due to load 44 standard cargoes in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Oseberg crude system is due to load the equivalent of 44 standard cargoes of 500,000 barrels each in January, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the programme comprised 30 cargoes of 600,000 barrrels, four cargoes of 500,000 barrels and two one-million tonne cargoes, totalling 36 actual loadings.  </p>
<p>The Oseberg system was expected to load 44 cargoes in December, but the tally in barrels was the same as January at 22 million.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
